 ('mapping_cylinder.rs',142,'Complete body read. Despite mapping-cylinder module name, added operation computes ordinary cone cell counts from an arbitrary base count list, with apex and shifted cells. Alternating sum one follows telescopically and is checked with overflow handling. It does not construct a mapping cylinder, a base complex, boundary or contraction. NotContractible is an error label for failed Euler arithmetic, not an equivalence between chi=1 and contractibility. Triangle-boundary test asserts only counts/Euler, so its disk title is not a separately checked topology result.'),
 ('primitive_decomposition.rs',153,'Complete body read. Header correctly demands coordinate direct sum and exact global image splitting before obstruction mass can add. DirectSumSplit verifies bounded basis partition and each supplied support staying within its block, but receives no global d0, coefficients, rank/span equality, subdomain or norm. It can accept empty local support lists while an omitted global image couples the blocks. PrimitiveStatus is only a freely serialized enum; no automatic certified status is minted here. The local positive/escaping-support tests establish support partition only; independent two-coordinate control shows why the stronger header premise matters.'),
